  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Uncovering circuit mechanisms of current sinks and sources with biophysical simulations of primary visual cortex (2022) in bioRxiv (Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory). 4 citations.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Uncovering circuit mechanisms of current sinks and sources with biophysical simulations of primary visual cortex (2022) in bioRxiv (Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory) is authored by Atle E. Rimehaug, A. Stasik and Espen Hagen. Topics: Neuroscience, Visual cortex, Local field potential, Computer science and Dissociation (chemistry).</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">4 citations (OpenAlex). Citations peaked in 2024 with 2 citing works. Citing venues include The Journal of Physiology, Nature Neuroscience and PLoS Computational Biology.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Limited online visibility beyond citations.</p>",
